   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Appeal: South Africa Power Shortage</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The South African Government is corrupt and failing their people, since 2007 the country has been experiencing loadshedding when they are cut off from power as the country can&apos;t meet demand. The issue is businesses are loosing money, children can&apos;t learn and all the global issues are getting harder to fight without power. We need to help our projects move to renewable energy and not reply on a corrupt and useless government. We can also help our footprint by using renewable energy</narrative>
  </description>
